{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19216","headline":"南海马大夫远示着述兼酬拙诗辄着微诚再有长句时蔡戎未弭故见於篇末 · 刘禹锡","name":"南海马大夫远示着述兼酬拙诗辄着微诚再有长句时蔡戎未弭故见於篇末","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家旄节付雄才，百越南溟统外台。\n身在绦纱传六艺，腰悬青绶亚三台。\n连天浪静长鲸息，映日帆多宝舶来。\n闻道楚氛犹未灭，终须旌斾扫云雷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}